{"id":"n25678-2-4","stage":3,"title":"볼 · 两腮","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n25678-2-4-1","ko":"너 볼의 살이 쪽 빠졌어. 그동안 무슨 일 있었어?","zh":"你的脸颊变瘦了啊。这段时间发生了什么事吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}},{"text":"볼의","meaning":"两腮，腮帮","explanation":"볼：两腮，腮帮；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"볼","audio":"/audio/88585628a473f6dabc46.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"25678","senseId":"2","lemma":"볼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"볼의","audio":"/audio/e32a7be79c496b917cbc.mp3"}},{"text":"살이","meaning":"身上的肉（与体重有关）","explanation":"살 指人身上的肉；살이 찌다 是长胖，살이 빠지다 是变瘦，살을 빼다 是减重。这里不是梳子齿、年龄或皮肤义。","readings":[{"term":"살","audio":"/audio/d804a5a98c800c56a6e4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66883","senseId":"1","lemma":"살","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"살이","audio":"/audio/10d950f9fb857268bb30.mp3"}},{"text":"쪽","meaning":"边","explanation":"쪽：边。","readings":[{"term":"쪽","audio":"/audio/077b6c57af048c3baee6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58147","senseId":"1","lemma":"쪽","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"쪽","audio":"/audio/077b6c57af048c3baee6.mp3"}},{"text":"빠졌어.","meaning":"掉，减轻，变瘦","explanation":"빠지다：掉，减轻，变瘦；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"빠지다","audio":"/audio/f1cb0821aeeaddd3adf4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66637","senseId":"10","lemma":"빠지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"빠졌어","audio":"/audio/650548c430a04d8adbaa.mp3"}},{"text":"그동안","meaning":"近来，这段时间","explanation":"그동안：近来，这段时间。","readings":[{"term":"그동안","audio":"/audio/d33dc138cdc9a561307b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60236","senseId":"1","lemma":"그동안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그동안","audio":"/audio/d33dc138cdc9a561307b.mp3"}},{"text":"무슨","meaning":"什么","explanation":"무슨：什么。","readings":[{"term":"무슨","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66237","senseId":"1","lemma":"무슨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"무슨","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3"}},{"text":"일","meaning":"事，事情","explanation":"일：事，事情。","readings":[{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91895","senseId":"3","lemma":"일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"}},{"text":"있었어?","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있었어","audio":"/audio/7f1221d9d5431e3ca85b.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"88585628a473f6da","term":"볼","zh":"两腮，腮帮","audio":"/audio/88585628a473f6dabc46.mp3","entryId":"25678","definition":"脸部两边、耳朵和嘴之间部分的肉。","pronunciation":["볼"]},{"id":"d804a5a98c800c56","term":"살","zh":"身上的肉（与体重有关）","audio":"/audio/d804a5a98c800c56a6e4.mp3","entryId":"66883","definition":"身上的肉（与体重有关）","pronunciation":["살"]},{"id":"077b6c57af048c3b","term":"쪽","zh":"边","audio":"/audio/077b6c57af048c3baee6.mp3","entryId":"58147","definition":"进行或朝向的方向。","pronunciation":["쪽"]},{"id":"f1cb0821aeeaddd3","term":"빠지다","zh":"掉，减轻，变瘦","audio":"/audio/f1cb0821aeeaddd3adf4.mp3","entryId":"66637","definition":"肥肉或体重等减少。","pronunciation":["빠ː지다"]},{"id":"d33dc138cdc9a561","term":"그동안","zh":"近来，这段时间","audio":"/audio/d33dc138cdc9a561307b.mp3","entryId":"60236","definition":"前面已经说过的那些时间；或指再次相逢或再次联系之前的一段时间。","pronunciation":["그동안"]},{"id":"41abb599007a8f8a","term":"무슨","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3","entryId":"66237","definition":"用于询问不确定或不知道的事情、对象、东西等。","pronunciation":["무슨"]},{"id":"dfc76879e2f5c3ea","term":"일","zh":"事，事情","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3","entryId":"91895","definition":"带有某种内容的情况或事实。","pronunciation":["일ː"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"有","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"事实或现象存在。","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/c3b503906d70270fc48b.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n25678-2-4-2","ko":"며칠 동안 감기를 앓아서 그런가 봐.","zh":"应该是这几天感冒了的关系吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"며칠","meaning":"几天","explanation":"며칠：几天。","readings":[{"term":"며칠","audio":"/audio/879abb6ed1ed4d59a03e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36676","senseId":"2","lemma":"며칠","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"며칠","audio":"/audio/879abb6ed1ed4d59a03e.mp3"}},{"text":"동안","meaning":"期间","explanation":"동안：期间。","readings":[{"term":"동안","audio":"/audio/2aa02e1d6b86b37d7e2b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70749","senseId":"1","lemma":"동안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"동안","audio":"/audio/2aa02e1d6b86b37d7e2b.mp3"}},{"text":"감기를","meaning":"感冒","explanation":"감기：感冒；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"감기","audio":"/audio/2c4cdf56b777f3677c17.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28635","senseId":"1","lemma":"감기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"감기를","audio":"/audio/04caea7d0302e83349ae.mp3"}},{"text":"앓아서","meaning":"患，得，病","explanation":"앓다：患，得，病；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"앓다","audio":"/audio/387f8dcdd779a212c4b6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62325","senseId":"1","lemma":"앓다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"앓아서","audio":"/audio/f47590afbabd9544fc0d.mp3"}},{"text":"그런가","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；ㄴ가：表示疑问或推测内容，常与 보다、싶다 等合用。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그런가","audio":"/audio/1871cee48506a0d12f8c.mp3"}},{"text":"봐.","meaning":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","explanation":"보다：看来、好像（根据情况推测）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62249","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"봐","audio":"/audio/fdcffec86114c54dd4e0.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"879abb6ed1ed4d59","term":"며칠","zh":"几天","audio":"/audio/879abb6ed1ed4d59a03e.mp3","entryId":"36676","definition":"几个日子。","pronunciation":["며칠"]},{"id":"2aa02e1d6b86b37d","term":"동안","zh":"期间","audio":"/audio/2aa02e1d6b86b37d7e2b.mp3","entryId":"70749","definition":"从某一时期另一时期之间的时间长度。","pronunciation":["동안"]},{"id":"2c4cdf56b777f367","term":"감기","zh":"感冒","audio":"/audio/2c4cdf56b777f3677c17.mp3","entryId":"28635","definition":"一般伴有咳嗽、流鼻涕、头痛、发冷等症状的传染病。","pronunciation":["감ː기"]},{"id":"387f8dcdd779a212","term":"앓다","zh":"患，得，病","audio":"/audio/387f8dcdd779a212c4b6.mp3","entryId":"62325","definition":"生病而感到痛苦或难受。","pronunciation":["알타"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62249","definition":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/85ffee7aebedcf88b814.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.817,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=25678","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"중급","day":99,"sequenceScore":2.6437,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["你的脸